Subject: [PATCH] ath11k: keep NSS peer ownership independent of host peers

Track immutable peer instances and independent CREATE/DELETE completions.
Wait for matching CREATE ACK, retain DMA through NACK/timeout/unmap, and
prevent reuse of unresolved peer IDs. Quiesce submissions before reset,
use private control waits, and revoke callback context on all reset outcomes.
Shared SRNG cleanup in upper error paths still requires a matching DMA fence.

